eave-keeps-date","title":"Leave the saved departure date untouched and change the passengers","goal":"Moving through the date field without picking a date leaves the submitted departure date unchanged","source":"authored","profile":"keyboard","path":"/","steps":[{"title":"Reach the departure date","action":{"kind":"seek","selector":"#departure","maxTabs":24},"assertions":[]},{"title":"Close the calendar without picking","action":{"kind":"press","key":"Escape"},"assertions":[]},{"title":"Reach passengers","action":{"kind":"seek","selector":"#passengers","maxTabs":24},"assertions":[]},{"title":"Change the passengers","action":{"kind":"type","text":"2","replace":true},"assertions":[]},{"title":"Reach Save changes","action":{"kind":"seek","selector":"#save","maxTabs":24},"assertions":[]},{"title":"Save","action":{"kind":"press","key":"Enter"},"assertions":[]}],"success":[{"kind":"text","selector":"#sent","value":"departure=2026-10-22&passengers=2"}],"functional":[{"kind":"form-data","selector":"#booking","name":"departure","value":["2026-10-22"]}],"forbidden":[]},"functionalJourney":{"version":1,"id":"bs6-datepicker-pointer-passengers","title":"Change the passengers with the pointer","goal":"Editing another field and saving submits the saved departure date","source":"authored","profile":"pointer","path":"/","steps":[{"title":"Click passengers","action":{"kind":"click","selector":"#passengers"},"assertions":[]},{"title":"Change the passengers","action":{"kind":"type","text":"3","replace":true},"assertions":[]},{"title":"Save","action":{"kind":"click","selector":"#save"},"assertions":[]}],"success":[{"kind":"text","selector":"#sent","value":"departure=2026-10-22&passengers=3"}],"functional":[{"kind":"form-data","selector":"#booking","name":"departure","value":["2026-10-22"]}],"forbidden":[]},"attempts":[{"attempt":1,"startedAt":"2026-10-26T07:32:06.003Z","verified":true,"category":null,"plan":{"root_cause":"The datepicker component formats the input value as a locale string (e.g., MM/DD/YYYY) when there is no separate display element, but the form expects the ISO string (YYYY-MM-DD) for submission. This causes the submitted departure date to be in the wrong format when the user leaves the field without changing the date.","repair_strategy":"Modify the `_formatDate` method to return the ISO string when the datepicker is attached to an input element and there is no separate display element, ensuring the input value remains in ISO format for proper form submission while preserving locale formatting for elements with a dedicated display element.","edits":[{"path":"js/src/datepicker.ts","sha256":"333ada052b9200667edf9078b105036dee5c1406a86e3865f6534e2ddb18c53a","before":"protected _formatDate(dateStr: string): string {\n    const date = this._parseDate(dateStr)\n    const locale = this._config.locale === 'default' ? undefined : this._config.locale\n    const { dateFormat } = this._config\n\n    // Custom function formatter\n    if (typeof dateFormat === 'function') {\n      return dateFormat(date, locale)\n    }\n\n    // Intl.DateTimeFormat options object\n    if (dateFormat && typeof dateFormat === 'object') {\n      return new Intl.DateTimeFormat(locale, dateFormat).format(date)\n    }\n\n    // Default: locale-aware formatting\n    return date.toLocaleDateString(locale)\n  }","after":"protected _formatDate(dateStr: string): string {\n    const date = this._parseDate(dateStr)\n    const locale = this._config.locale === 'default' ? undefined : this._config.locale\n    const { dateFormat } = this._config\n\n    // If we are using the input for display (no separate display element) and we are an input,\n    // then we want to use ISO format for the value.\n    if (!this._displayElement && this._isInput) {\n      // Return ISO string: YYYY-MM-DD\n      const year = date.getFullYear()\n      const month = String(date.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0')\n      const day = String(date.getDate()).padStart(2, '0')\n      return `${year}-${month}-${day}`\n    }\n\n    // Custom function formatter\n    if (typeof dateFormat === 'function') {\n      return dateFormat(date, locale)\n    }\n\n    // Intl.DateTimeFormat options object\n    if (dateFormat && typeof dateFormat === 'object') {\n      return new Intl.DateTimeFormat(locale, dateFormat).format(date)\n    }\n\n    // Default: locale-aware formatting\n    return date.toLocaleDateString(locale)\n  }"}],"expected_accessibility_effect":"The change ensures form data is submitted in the correct ISO format, which is machine-readable and consistent. The date display in input fields will now show ISO format (YYYY-MM-DD) instead of locale format, which remains accessible and unambiguous though may be less familiar to some users.","functional_risks":["Users accustomed to local date formats may find ISO format less readable","If the form relies on locale format for display (e.g., readability), user experience may be impacted","Form submission will now work correctly with ISO format"],"verification_requirements":["Verify departure date field retains ISO format (YYYY-MM-DD) after initialization and after interacting with datepicker without changing date","Verify selecting a date updates input value to corresponding ISO string","Verify form submission includes departure date in ISO format","Ensure change does not break datepicker functionality for elements with separate display element (non-inputs or when displayElement is configured)"]},"provenance":{"provider":"Nebius Token Factory","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","requestId":"chatcmpl-9a10dc2995671367f06b58cd7f16674e","promptHash":"b9bc7371da3b3750f04aeee4c7adc41aef788ea0dadb7ddb37a1ad05aadb3f79","jsonRepaired":true,"schemaVersion":2,"structuredOutput":false,"latencyMs":56141,"usage":{"completion_tokens":11634,"prompt_tokens":14825,"total_tokens":26459,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":10727,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null},"prompt_to